\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. With gladness we worship,
\par Rejoice as we sing,
\par Free hearts and free voices 
\par how blessed to bring
\par The old, thankful story shall scale Thine abode,
\par Thou King of all glory, most bountiful God.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy right would we give Thee-
\par True homage Thy due,
\par And honour eternal, 
\par the universe through,
\par With all Thy creation, earth, heaven and sea,
\par In one acclamation we celebrate Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Renewed by Thy Spirit, 
\par redeemed by Thy Son,
\par Thy children revere Thee 
\par for all Thou hast done,
\par Father ! returning to love and to light,
\par Thy children are yearning to praise Thee aright.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. We join with the angels, 
\par and so there is given
\par From earth Hallelujah, 
\par in answer to Heaven,
\par Amen ! Be Thou glorious below and above,
\par Redeeming, victorious, and infinite Love !
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

